    AgentCore --> HexStrikeClient[🔌 HexStrikeClient<br/>PROXY HTTP]
    
    HexStrikeClient --> |HTTP:8888| HexStrikeServer[⚔️ HexStrike Server<br/>COORDINATOR EXTERNO]
    
    Orchestrator --> AIProvider[🤖 AI Provider Factory<br/>OpenAI/LMStudio/OpenRouter]
    Orchestrator --> MCPManager[🛠️ MCP Manager<br/>Tool Registry]
    
    HexStrikeServer --> |Shell Commands| ZSH[💻 ZSH / Security Tools<br/>Nmap, Nuclei, etc.]
    
